  17 ========== => target:t3
  18 . R   0  0 | endif
  19 . R   0  0 |
  20 . R   1  0 | ## Docs above ifdef and else
  21 . R   1  0 | ifdef X
  22 . R   1  0 | else
  23 . R   0  0 | t4:
